    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Added the initial FF9 plugin shell. Lexeditor now finds Steam app 377840 through its manifest, validates FF9_Launcher.exe, and opens an FF9-themed shared editor with Abilities, Accessories, Armor, Characters, Encounters, Enemies, Items, Magic, Shops, Synthesis, Tweaks, Weapons, Settings, Info, and Data Map destinations. The plugin clearly marks every data area as not integrated, disables Save, and rejects write requests because no FF9 parser exists yet. Managed startup and shutdown, plugin identity, automatic install detection, host navigation, Data Map, and the hidden rendered screen passed.",
